218	/// Tests for the retry layer.
219	///
220	/// All of these run on a paused tokio clock: `retry_rpc` sleeps 5+15+45 = 65 seconds
221	/// across a full exhaustion, and the schedule itself is part of what is being asserted,
222	/// so virtual time is both the fast and the precise option.
